#     + represents the multiple time 1 or more repitions
#     simi@1234.edu here expression says that there is @ on its left side we have some alphabets . 
#     represent alphabets and + represent the one or more char same on the right . + and the /.edu  
#    / is used to seprate them from . + operators and / have a hint that after that we have something to match
